; 絵本パート
; ==============================================================================
; 月代ユキの物語
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論11 絵本パート
; BGM変更なし／燦色の檻

@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_1_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

; イラスト1 ユキ1人（イラスト差分の基礎）
; 「孤独で長い道のり」を表現するため、中央にユキがいる状態で差分を作る形
; ※ただ全体、これまでと違って優しめな雰囲気は出したいかもです！
@SpawnExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S01 Wait:false
@Wait WaitMode:1.5
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:那是一个，很久很久以前的故事。|#0206Trial10_Yuki001| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:曾经在那座岛上，有许多魔女和睦地生活在一起。|#0206Trial10_Yuki002| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女们天生拥有魔法的力量，<br>并发展出了独属于她们的文明。|#0206Trial10_Yuki003| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们偶尔与来到岛上的人类接触，<br>却始终避免与外界打交道，过着平静的生活。|#0206Trial10_Yuki004| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但——<br>和平的日常，迎来了终结。|#0206Trial10_Yuki005| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S01 Wait:false LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; イラスト2 ユキシルエットに ＋ 背景に炎
@SpawnExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S02 Wait:false
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:人类的军队出现了。<br>他们捕捉、杀害魔女们，还破坏了岛屿。|#0206Trial10_Yuki006| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:活下来的是统治魔女之岛的大魔女中的一人……|#0206Trial10_Yuki007| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:年纪最小，却最擅长魔法的——雪。<br>只有小雪一人幸存。|#0206Trial10_Yuki008| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S02 Wait:false LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; イラスト3 背景暗く
@SpawnExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S03 Wait:false
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:她决心为同胞复仇。|#0206Trial10_Yuki009| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了让人们遭受和魔女们同样的命运，<br>她剥裂自己的灵魂，<br>将其转化为魔女因子并散播给人类。|#0206Trial10_Yuki010| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是一种诅咒。能让人类变成自己创造出来的幻想怪物——<br>【魔女】，并最终死去。|#0206Trial10_Yuki011| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她在复仇心的支配下，<br>将一个捡来的人类少女……<br>梅露露当作实验体，完成了术法。|#0206Trial10_Yuki012| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然因为人类的繁殖力太强，<br>要让每个人都感染魔女因子需要很长时间……|#0206Trial10_Yuki013| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但她始终没有放弃。|#0206Trial10_Yuki014| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:许多年后，<br>当几乎所有人类都成功植入了魔女因子时……|#0206Trial10_Yuki015| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她遇见了两个少女。|#0206Trial10_Yuki016| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S03 Wait:false LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; イラスト4 画面端側の左右にエマ・ヒロが登場
@SpawnExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S04 Wait:false
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:那就是艾玛和希罗。|#0206Trial10_Yuki017| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在与她们心灵相通的过程中，<br>小雪心中的复仇之火逐渐变得黯淡。|#0206Trial10_Yuki018| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的内心……产生了迷茫。|#0206Trial10_Yuki019| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是她无法停下。<br>……她不可以停下。|#0206Trial10_Yuki020| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以，她把一切都托付给了艾玛。|#0206Trial10_Yuki021| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:将人类的命运……以及自己的复仇计划……|#0206Trial10_Yuki022| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如同将赌注交给命运，<br>她把自己精心铺陈的计划，<br>托付给了他人之手。|#0206Trial10_Yuki023| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:最终……|#0206Trial10_Yuki024| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S04 Wait:false LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

; イラスト5 最初のイラストの差分で、ユキの左右にエマ・ヒロが寄り添っている。穏やか・笑顔みなイラストがいいかも。ユキは目を閉じる
@SpawnExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S05 Wait:false
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

[PrintTextModified Text:我终究……还是没有做到。|#0206Trial10_Yuki025| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是太过漫长的岁月让感情渐渐麻木……|#0206Trial10_Yuki026| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:还是我与人类交集得太深……|#0206Trial10_Yuki027| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我的复仇之心……已经锈蚀了。|#0206Trial10_Yuki028| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:岛上的魔女们……会不会笑我呢。|#0206Trial10_Yuki029| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些变成魔女、因此死去的人类们……<br>会不会怨恨我呢。|#0206Trial10_Yuki030| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便如此……|#0206Trial10_Yuki031| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:此刻我只想，<br>任由自己沉浸在这温柔的浅眠之中——|#0206Trial10_Yuki032| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Reenact_Ch02_E06_S05 Wait:false LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.5

